  "abstract": {
    "value": "Based on our experience in this area, we chose 1-decyne, benzaldehyde, and morpholine as the starting point: with $\\mathrm { F e C l } _ { 3 }$ or MgI<sub>2</sub>, the formation of allene 3aa was not observed (entries 1 and 2, Table 1). After extensive screening, it is fortunate to observe that when CdI was used, allene 3aa was formed in 36% yield (entry 3, Table 1)! Further screening led to the observation that cheaper $\\mathrm { Z n I } _ { 2 }$ may play the same role affording 3aa in a slightly higher yield (entry 4, Table 1). ZnX (Cl or Br) is not effective; Zn(OTf) afforded 3aa in 19% NMR yield after 4.8 h.",
